* Series-series resonant wireless power link
* Stage 1 educational model: 5 V peak source, 10 ohm AC load

.param F=100k
.param K=0.10

V1 in 0 AC 3.5355339 SINE(0 5 {F})
Rsource in n1 2
C1 n1 n2 82n
L1 n2 0 30u Rser=0.3

L2 n3 0 30u Rser=0.3
C2 n3 out 82n
Rload out 0 10

K1 L1 L2 {K}

.tran 0 2m 0 50n
.ac lin 1601 60k 140k

.meas tran Vin_rms RMS V(in) FROM 1.5m TO 2m
.meas tran Vout_rms RMS V(out) FROM 1.5m TO 2m
.meas tran Iprimary_rms RMS I(L1) FROM 1.5m TO 2m
.meas tran Isecondary_rms RMS I(L2) FROM 1.5m TO 2m
.meas tran Pload AVG V(out)*I(Rload) FROM 1.5m TO 2m

.end

